---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---

<Base title="Privacy" description="What data this website collects: essentially none.">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>This site is a static set of pages. It has no accounts, forms, comments or database.</p>
    <h2>What is not used</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>No cookies, no local storage, no fingerprinting.</li>
      <li>No third-party scripts, fonts, embeds or trackers. Fonts are served from this site.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>What is collected</h2>
    <p>
      The hosting provider (Cloudflare) processes standard request metadata (such as IP address and
      user agent) to deliver the site and protect it from abuse, and provides aggregate traffic
      statistics. No tracking script runs in your browser.
    </p>
    <!-- TODO(giovanni): confirm the analytics choice. If you enable Cloudflare Web Analytics
         (cookieless) it injects a script from static.cloudflareinsights.com, which requires
         updating the CSP in public/_headers AND this page. See docs/security.md. -->
    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p>
      If you write to <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>, the message is forwarded by
      Cloudflare Email Routing to a personal mailbox and kept only as long as needed to reply.
    </p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this page: the same address above.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
